  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "1. Ensure full compliance with user request: 'L'Atelier des parfums' logo & title, BuyLive-inspired order structure with Montant + Référence + Pseudo + Customer Details + Chronopost / Mondial Relay shipping + Stripe real card payment + Admin account dashboard.",
    "2. Implement backend APIs in server.py: GET/POST /api/orders, PUT /api/orders/{id}/status, POST /api/create-payment-intent (Stripe), POST /api/admin/login, GET /api/admin/stats.",
    "3. Add mock data for initial admin view so the admin dashboard presents existing sample orders right after startup.",
    "4. Ensure every button, input, tab, card, and row includes its designated data-testid attribute.",
    "5. Use Sonner toasts for clear user feedback upon order creation, copy link, payment success, or login errors.",
    "6. Make the checkout experience smooth on mobile devices with sticky subtotal bars and step progress indicator."
  ]
}